      "content": "SP 90 NE                          ASHLEY GREEN           TWO DELLS LANE 1/13                                                          Ashley Cottage II Late C17 timber-framed house, refronted C18 in brick and extended to left by one bay C19 and rear wing to form letter L-plan.  Brick.  Old tile roofs.  Two storeys, 3 bay north front.  C18 right hand bays with central entrance behind modern porch. Grey headers.  Painted brick infilling to timber-framing exposed at rear.  Left bay in red brick with gable and 2 storey rear wing both colourwashed.  Casement windows, mostly 3-light lean-to at left of front elevation.  End stacks. Listing NGR: SP9768305158"
    }
